  "body": "Solid Brick, Endless Potential\r\nWelcome to 27 Vanbrugh Place, a spacious family home offering solid construction, versatile living and exciting potential to add value in a sought-after Bucklands Beach location.\r\n\r\nBuilt 1970's and set on a generous 653sqm (more or less) section, this substantial brick home provides the space and flexibility growing families need, with plenty of scope to refresh, modernise and make it your own.\r\n\r\nInside, you'll find four well-proportioned bedrooms and two bathrooms, complemented by a separate lounge and dining area, plus an additional family room and rumpus. Whether you need extra room for the kids, a dedicated hobby space or somewhere to entertain friends and family, the options here are plentiful.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen is equipped with a gas stove and dishwasher, while a separate laundry adds everyday practicality. A heat pump and ceiling insulation help keep things comfortable throughout the seasons, and the solid brick exterior provides a reassuring foundation for your future plans.\r\n\r\nStep outdoors and discover a lovely deck and patio, perfectly positioned to enjoy the northerly aspect and urban outlook. The fully fenced grounds offer a private setting for children and pets to play, weekend barbecues and relaxed family living.\r\n\r\nParking and storage are well catered for with a double garage and additional off-street parking.\r\n\r\nLocation is another key advantage. Positioned in a popular Bucklands Beach neighbourhood, you're within easy reach of local schools, beaches, reserves and everyday amenities, with the added appeal of Macleans College zoning.\r\n\r\nSolid brick construction, generous space and genuine potential make this a fantastic opportunity for families looking to secure their place in Bucklands Beach and create a home that reflects their own style.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking to move in and gradually make improvements or explore the possibilities from day one, 27 Vanbrugh Place deserves your attention.\r\n\r\nOffered for sale by negotiation.\r\nContact us today for further information or to arrange your viewing. Your next chapter starts here!",
